    <!-- Video Selfie Feature Section -->
    <section class="video-selfie-feature">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-header" data-aos="fade-up">
                <h2>The Key Recovery Problem</h2>
                <p>First in the world gesture based video selfie authentication for practical key recovery</p>
            </div>

            <!-- The Problem -->
            <div class="recovery-problem" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
                <h3>How Do You Recover Lost Keys Without Trusted Third Parties?</h3>
                <p>Your authentication happens via private and public keypairs derived from a randomly generated secret. This secret is stored securely client side behind biometrically secured local storage.</p>
                <p class="problem-statement">But what happens when your device is lost or the application is uninstalled and local storage is purged?</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Traditional Solutions Problems -->
            <div class="traditional-problems" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
                <h3>Traditional Recovery Approaches Have Critical Flaws</h3>
                <div class="problems-grid">
                    <div class="problem-card">
                        <div class="problem-icon warning">🏦</div>
                        <h4>Custodial Recovery</h4>
                        <p>Trust Fireblocks, Coinbase Custody, or similar third parties. Creates the exact security risks NI6 was built to eliminate.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="problem-card">
                        <div class="problem-icon warning">👥</div>
                        <h4>Social Recovery</h4>
                        <p>Manual process requiring friends or family to approve recovery. Slow, relies on others, creates social pressure.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="problem-card">
                        <div class="problem-icon warning">📸</div>
                        <h4>Static Selfie</h4>
                        <p>Automated recovery using a single selfie image. Better than custodial but has spoofing risks with deepfakes.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="problem-card">
                        <div class="problem-icon warning">💬</div>
                        <h4>SMS or Email OTP</h4>
                        <p>Vulnerable to SIM swapping, SS7 attacks, and account takeovers. Not acceptable for cryptographic key recovery.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- The NI6 Solution -->
            <div class="ni6-solution" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="300">
                <div class="solution-badge">
                    <span class="badge-icon">🌍</span>
                    <span class="badge-text">World First</span>
                </div>
                <h3>Gesture Based Video Selfie Authentication</h3>
                <p>NI6 invented the first practical key recovery system that combines Shamir Secret Sharing for distributed storage with gesture based video selfie authentication for recovery requests. No third parties. No manual processes. No SMS vulnerabilities.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- How It Works -->
            <div class="recovery-flow" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="400">
                <h3>The Two Part Solution</h3>
                <div class="flow-parts">
                    <div class="flow-part">
                        <div class="part-number">1</div>
                        <h4>Distributed Storage</h4>
                        <p>Shamir Secret Sharing (2 of 3) splits your secret across independent servers. No single server has your complete key. But how do you prove you should get those shares back?</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flow-divider">→</div>
                    <div class="flow-part featured">
                        <div class="part-number">2</div>
                        <h4>Gesture Based Recovery</h4>
                        <p>Record a video selfie showing specific hand gestures at precise times. MediaPipe detects 21 hand landmarks. The gesture sequence serves as your OTP. Practically unhackable.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Hand Gesture Animation -->
            <div class="gesture-animation" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="500">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 900 500" class="gesture-svg">
                    <!-- Background -->
                    <rect width="900" height="500" fill="#0a0a0f"/>
                    <rect width="900" height="500" fill="url(#gestureGrid)"/>

                    <!-- Grid pattern definition -->
                    <defs>
                        <pattern id="gestureGrid" width="20" height="20" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
                            <path d="M 20 0 L 0 0 0 20" fill="none" stroke="#1a1a2e" stroke-width="0.5"/>
                        </pattern>
                    </defs>

                    <!-- Title -->
                    <text x="450" y="40" text-anchor="middle" fill="#ffffff" font-family="Inter" font-size="18" font-weight="600">How Gesture Based Recovery Works</text>

                    <!-- Timeline -->
                    <g transform="translate(50, 80)">
                        <!-- Stage 1: Recording -->
                        <g class="stage stage-1" transform="translate(0, 0)">
                            <rect x="0" y="0" width="200" height="320" rx="12" fill="#1a1a2e" stroke="#6366f1" stroke-width="2"/>
                            <text x="100" y="30" text-anchor="middle" fill="#6366f1" font-family="Inter" font-size="14" font-weight="600">1. Record Recovery Video</text>

                            <!-- Camera icon -->
                            <circle cx="100" cy="65" r="25" fill="rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.15)"/>
                            <circle cx="100" cy="65" r="12" fill="#6366f1"/>
                            <circle cx="100" cy="65" r="6" fill="#1a1a2e"/>

                            <!-- Single ASL Hand Gesture (V-sign for digit 2) -->
                            <g transform="translate(50, 110)">
                                <!-- Hand outline circle -->
                                <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="45" fill="none" stroke="#6366f1" stroke-width="2"/>

                                <!-- Hand base (palm/fist) -->
                                <ellipse cx="50" cy="70" rx="25" ry="30" fill="rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.1)" stroke="#6366f1" stroke-width="2"/>

                                <!-- Index finger (extended) -->
                                <line x1="38" y1="50" x2="38" y2="10" stroke="#6366f1" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/>

                                <!-- Middle finger (extended) -->
                                <line x1="62" y1="50" x2="62" y2="10" stroke="#6366f1" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/>

                                <!-- Ring finger (folded) -->
                                <ellipse cx="72" cy="60" rx="4" ry="12" fill="#6366f1"/>

                                <!-- Pinky (folded) -->
                                <ellipse cx="80" cy="65" rx="3" ry="10" fill="#6366f1"/>

                                <!-- Thumb (folded) -->
                                <ellipse cx="28" cy="65" rx="5" ry="10" fill="#6366f1"/>

                                <!-- Large number below -->
                                <text x="50" y="135" text-anchor="middle" fill="#6366f1" font-family="Inter" font-size="48" font-weight="700">2</text>
                            </g>

                                <!-- Digit 1 removed - now using single gesture display -->
                                <!-- Digit 2 removed -->

                                <!-- Digit 3 removed -->

                                <!-- Digit 4: ASL four (all fingers except thumb) -->
                                <g transform="translate(55, 85)">
                                    <!-- ASL 4: Removed -->
                                    <ellipse cx="25" cy="35" rx="18" ry="22" fill="none" stroke="#6366f1" stroke-width="2"/>
                                    <line x1="10" y1="20" x2="10" y2="0" stroke="#6366f1" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                                    <line x1="18" y1="18" x2="18" y2="0" stroke="#6366f1" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                                    <line x1="26" y1="18" x2="26" y2="0" stroke="#6366f1" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                                    <line x="34" y1="20" x2="34" y2="0" stroke="#6366f1" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                                    <text x="25" y="70" text-anchor="middle" fill="#6366f1" font-family="Inter" font-size="28" font-weight="700">4</text>
                                </g>

                                <!-- Digit 5: ASL five (all five fingers extended) -->
                                <g transform="translate(100, 85)">
                                    <!-- ASL 5: All fingers extended including thumb -->
                                    <ellipse cx="25" cy="35" rx="18" ry="22" fill="none" stroke="#6366f1" stroke-width="2"/>
                                    <line x1="10" y1="18" x2="10" y2="0" stroke="#6366f1" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                                    <line x1="17" y1="16" x2="17" y2="0" stroke="#6366f1" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                                    <line x1="24" y1="16" x2="24" y2="0" stroke="#6366f1" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                                    <line x1="31" y1="18" x2="31" y2="0" stroke="#6366f1" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                                    <line x1="38" y1="20" x2="38" y2="0" stroke="#6366f1" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                                    <text x="25" y="70" text-anchor="middle" fill="#6366f1" font-family="Inter" font-size="28" font-weight="700">5</text>
                                </g>
                            </g>

                            <text x="100" y="275" text-anchor="middle" fill="#888888" font-family="Inter" font-size="9">Show 4 digits at specific times</text>
                            <text x="100" y="292" text-anchor="middle" fill="#888888" font-family="Inter" font-size="8">4.5s, 8.5s, 12.5s, 16.5s</text>
                        </g>

                        <!-- Arrow -->
                        <path d="M 200 150 L 240 150" stroke="#00d4aa" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrowWhite)" class="flow-line"/>

                        <!-- Stage 2: Detection -->
                        <g class="stage stage-2" transform="translate(250, 0)">
                            <rect x="0" y="0" width="200" height="300" rx="12" fill="#1a1a2e" stroke="#8b5cf6" stroke-width="2"/>
                            <text x="100" y="30" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b5cf6" font-family="Inter" font-size="14" font-weight="600">2. MediaPipe Detects</text>

                            <!-- Hand landmark visualization -->
                            <g transform="translate(50, 70)">
                                <!-- Hand outline -->
                                <ellipse cx="50" cy="60" rx="40" ry="50" fill="none" stroke="#8b5cf6" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="4,4"/>

                                <!-- 21 landmark points -->
                                <circle cx="50" cy="30" r="3" fill="#8b5cf6"/>
                                <circle cx="50" cy="20" r="3" fill="#8b5cf6"/>
                                <circle cx="50" cy="10" r="3" fill="#8b5cf6"/>

                                <circle cx="35" cy="35" r="3" fill="#8b5cf6"/>
                                <circle cx="30" cy="25" r="3" fill="#8b5cf6"/>
                                <circle cx="28" cy="15" r="3" fill="#8b5cf6"/>

                                <circle cx="65" cy="35" r="3" fill="#8b5cf6"/>
                                <circle cx="70" cy="25" r="3" fill="#8b5cf6"/>
                                <circle cx="72" cy="15" r="3" fill="#8b5cf6"/>

                                <!-- More landmarks -->
                                <circle cx="40" cy="50" r="3" fill="#8b5cf6"/>
                                <circle cx="35" cy="45" r="3" fill="#8b5cf6"/>
                                <circle cx="60" cy="50" r="3" fill="#8b5cf6"/>
                                <circle cx="65" cy="45" r="3" fill="#8b5cf6"/>

                                <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="3" fill="#00d4aa"/>
                                <circle cx="50" cy="70" r="3" fill="#8b5cf6"/>
                                <circle cx="50" cy="85" r="3" fill="#8b5cf6"/>
                                <circle cx="40" cy="90" r="3" fill="#8b5cf6"/>
                                <circle cx="60" cy="90" r="3" fill="#8b5cf6"/>
                            </g>

                            <text x="100" y="170" text-anchor="middle" fill="#00d4aa" font-family="Inter" font-size="11" font-weight="600">21 Landmark Points</text>
                            <text x="100" y="190" text-anchor="middle" fill="#888888" font-family="Inter" font-size="10">Per finger joint</text>

                            <!-- Detection info -->
                            <g transform="translate(20, 210)">
                                <rect x="0" y="0" width="160" height="70" rx="8" fill="rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1)"/>
                                <text x="80" y="20" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b5cf6" font-family="Inter" font-size="10" font-weight="600">Frame Accurate Sampling</text>
                                <text x="80" y="40" text-anchor="middle" fill="#888888" font-family="Inter" font-size="9">Extracts gesture at</text>
                                <text x="80" y="55" text-anchor="middle" fill="#888888" font-family="Inter" font-size="9">exact timestamps</text>
                            </g>
                        </g>

                        <!-- Arrow -->
                        <path d="M 450 150 L 490 150" stroke="#00d4aa" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrowWhite)" class="flow-line"/>

                        <!-- Stage 3: Verification -->
                        <g class="stage stage-3" transform="translate(500, 0)">
                            <rect x="0" y="0" width="200" height="300" rx="12" fill="#1a1a2e" stroke="#00d4aa" stroke-width="2"/>
                            <text x="100" y="30" text-anchor="middle" fill="#00d4aa" font-family="Inter" font-size="14" font-weight="600">3. Shares Returned</text>

                            <!-- Success animation -->
                            <g transform="translate(50, 60)">
                                <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="40" fill="rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.1)"/>
                                <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="30" fill="rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.15)"/>
                                <path d="M 35 50 L 45 60 L 65 40" fill="none" stroke="#22c55e" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                            </g>

                            <!-- OTP Display -->
                            <g transform="translate(20, 140)">
                                <text x="80" y="18" text-anchor="middle" fill="#888888" font-family="Inter" font-size="10">Detected OTP (4 digits)</text>
                                <rect x="0" y="28" width="160" height="45" rx="8" fill="rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.1)"/>
                                <text x="80" y="58" text-anchor="middle" fill="#22c55e" font-family="Inter" font-size="22" font-weight="700" letter-spacing="6">3-1-5-2</text>
                            </g>

                            <!-- Benefits -->
                            <g transform="translate(20, 200)">
                                <rect x="0" y="0" width="160" height="80" rx="8" fill="rgba(0, 212, 170, 0.05)"/>
                                <text x="80" y="20" text-anchor="middle" fill="#00d4aa" font-family="Inter" font-size="10" font-weight="600">Secret Recovered</text>
                                <text x="80" y="40" text-anchor="middle" fill="#888888" font-family="Inter" font-size="8">✓ No third parties</text>
                                <text x="80" y="52" text-anchor="middle" fill="#888888" font-family="Inter" font-size="8">✓ No SMS needed</text>
                                <text x="80" y="64" text-anchor="middle" fill="#888888" font-family="Inter" font-size="8">✓ Fully automated</text>
                            </g>
                        </g>
                    </g>

                    <!-- Arrow marker -->
                    <defs>
                        <marker id="arrowWhite" markerWidth="10" markerHeight="10" refX="9" refY="3" orient="auto">
                            <polygon points="0 0, 10 3, 0 6" fill="#00d4aa"/>
                        </marker>
                    </defs>
                </svg>
            </div>

            <!-- Why Superior -->
            <div class="gesture-benefits" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="600">
                <h3>Why Gesture Based Video is Superior to Static Selfie</h3>
                <div class="benefits-cards">
                    <div class="gesture-benefit">
                        <div class="benefit-number">01</div>
                        <h4>Deepfake Resistant</h4>
                        <p>AI generated videos cannot match natural hand gesture dynamics and timing</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="gesture-benefit">
                        <div class="benefit-number">02</div>
                        <h4>Anti Replay Attack</h4>
                        <p>Each video is unique with time based gesture sequence, cannot be reused</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="gesture-benefit">
                        <div class="benefit-number">03</div>
                        <h4>No Third Parties</h4>
                        <p>No custodians, no social recovery guardians, just cryptographic proof</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="gesture-benefit">
                        <div class="benefit-number">04</div>
                        <h4>Fully Automated</h4>
                        <p>No manual approval processes, recovery completes in seconds</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- World First Badge -->
            <div class="world-first" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="700">
                <div class="world-first-content">
                    <div class="world-first-icon">🏆</div>
                    <div class="world-first-text">
                        <h4>First in the World</h4>
                        <p>NI6 is the first system to combine distributed secret storage with gesture based video selfie authentication for practical key recovery. No other solution offers this level of security without trusted third parties.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Quick Start -->
    <section class="quickstart" id="quickstart">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-header" data-aos="fade-up">
                <h2>Quick Start</h2>
                <p>Get NI6 running in minutes</p>
            </div>
            <div class="code-block" data-aos="flip-up" data-aos-delay="200">
                <div class="code-header">
                    <span class="code-title">Terminal</span>
                    <button class="copy-btn" id="copyBtn">
                        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                            <rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2" ry="2"/>
                            <path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"/>
                        </svg>
                        Copy
                    </button>
                </div>
                <pre><code class="language-bash" id="installCode"># Clone repository
git clone https://github.com/your-org/ni6.git
cd ni6

# Install dependencies with Poetry
poetry install

# Copy environment configuration
cp deploy/.env.example deploy/.env

# Edit deploy/.env with your database credentials
# Required: MariaDB host, port, user, password
# Required: RethinkDB host, port, database

# Create databases and load schemas
./deploy/setup-database.sh

# Start all 3 NI6 instances
./deploy/start-instances.sh</code></pre>
            </div>
            <div class="instance-info" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="300">
